{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"ceaeb558-3250-4551-bacc-a0d6c9f10d94","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The soundness review for lane `packsel` (Experiment E8 packed selectors and degree bounds) is complete. All three deliverables have been written under `qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/`:\n\n1. [packsel.qnt](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/packsel.qnt) — Parameterised base module [`packsel_base`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/packsel.qnt#L12-L802), sound baseline instance [`packsel_sound`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/packsel.qnt#L804-L806), and all 9 mutant instances (`P1`–`P9`: [`packsel_same_code`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/packsel.qnt#L808-L810) through [`packsel_abs_two_codes`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/packsel.qnt#L824-L826)).\n2. [packsel_test.qnt](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/packsel_test.qnt) — 24 deterministic and exhaustive tests in [`packsel_test`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/packsel_test.qnt#L6-L291), including the exact replay check [`narrowPackReplayExactTest`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/packsel_test.qnt#L33-L48), exhaustive layout and single-gate tamper checks across all 52 `(Arch, s, deg)` configurations ([`exhaustiveAllLayoutsHonestTest`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/packsel_test.qnt#L63-L70), [`exhaustiveSoundRejectsAllSingleTampersTest`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/packsel_test.qnt#L73-L82)), non-vacuity checks showing honest/adapted witnesses refine under the mutants, and counterexample checks for `P1`–`P9`.\n3. [REPORT-packsel.md](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/REPORT-packsel.md) — Complete soundness report covering verdicts for `Q1a`–`Q1d`, conditions `C1`–`C6`, findings `F1`–`F6`, the `P1`–`P9` mutant matrix, model abstractions, and the exact `quint` verification commands.\n\n### Summary of Verdicts (`Q1a`–`Q1d`)\n\n- **Overall Verdict**: **SOUND WITH CONDITIONS (`C1`–`C6`)**. Every layout in [rfcore.rs](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/crates/mori-chip/src/rfcore.rs#L168-L221) (`Arch::Narrow`, `Arch::Wide`, `Arch::WideInline`, `Arch::Staggered`) and all four packed-selector subsystems ([vsel.rs](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/crates/mori-chip/src/vsel.rs#L51-L119), [rfcore.rs](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/crates/mori-chip/src/rfcore.rs#L884-L962), [poseidon.rs](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/crates/mori-chip/src/poseidon.rs#L173-L315), [m3.rs](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/crates/mori-chip/src/m3.rs#L103-L391), [mem.rs](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/crates/mori-chip/src/mem.rs#L133-L216)) satisfy `C1`–`C6`.\n- **Exact `vsel::pack` Replay on `Arch::Narrow`**: Excluding `dgi = 0` (slot row `1`, on `VSel::Simple(q_dec)`), the 6 core gates `gi = 1..6` (slot rows `[3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 12]`, body degrees `[3, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2]`) plus `rf count0` (region row `cnt_row = 0`, body degree `1`) stably sort by `Reverse(deg)` into `[0, 1, 2, 5, 3, 4, 6]` and pack into **2 columns**:\n  - **Core Col 0 (`n = 3`, max deg `3 + 3 = 6`)**: `code 1` $\\to$ `gi = 1` (row 3, deg 3), `code 2` $\\to$ `gi = 2` (row 5, deg 2), `code 3` $\\to$ `gi = 3` (row 7, deg 2).\n  - **Core Col 1 (`n = 4`, max deg `4 + 2 = 6`)**: `code 1` $\\to$ `gi = 6` (row 12, deg 2), `code 2` $\\to$ `gi = 4` (row 9, deg 1), `code 3` $\\to$ `gi = 5` (row 11, deg 1), `code 4` $\\to$ `rf count0` (`cnt_row = 0`, deg 1).\n- **Overwrite Collision Analysis (`Q1c` / Finding `F1`)**: Neither [`VSel::enable`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/crates/mori-chip/src/vsel.rs#L58-L63) nor `midnight-proofs` `assign_fixed` asserts against writing two codes to the same `(Column\u003cFixed\u003e, row)` (last-write-wins). Soundness holds because:\n  1. On `Arch::Narrow`, [`Layout::canon`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/crates/mori-chip/src/rfcore.rs#L224-L226) returns the first `Cell::Cnt` placement (`cnt_row = 0`), whose residue `0 mod 13` is disjoint from `{9, 11, 12} mod 13` in Core Col 1 (whereas picking the 4th placement `cnt_row = 12` overwrites `gi = 6` on slot 0, caught by `P2` [`packsel_cnt_collides`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/packsel.qnt#L810)).\n  2. On `Arch::Wide` (`cnt_row = 0 = gates[0]`) and `Arch::Staggered` (`cnt_row = 1 = gates[0]`), `cnt_row` coincides with slot 0's `dgi = 0` row, and a collision is avoided **solely** because `dgi = 0` is excluded from [`vsel::pack`](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/crates/mori-chip/src/vsel.rs#L85-L119) (`gi != dgi` at [rfcore.rs:891](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/crates/mori-chip/src/rfcore.rs#L891)) and placed on `VSel::Simple(q_dec)`.\n- **Sandbox Note**: As noted in [REPORT-packsel.md](file:///home/hoskinson/.cache/gemini-lanes/chipleaf-final-packsel/qa/gemini-quint/chipleaf-final/REPORT-packsel.md#L219-L254), `quint --version` was refused by the sandbox, so all `quint typecheck`, `quint test`, and `quint run` commands are listed with their exact flags and expected exit codes in Section 6 of the report for the lead's re-run.\n","duration_seconds":1437.129856593,"num_turns":4,"usage":{"input_tokens":665748,"output_tokens":116284,"thinking_tokens":70778,"cache_read_tokens":2625364,"total_tokens":782032},"denied_actions":[{"action":"read_file","display_name":"ReadFile"},{"action":"write_file","display_name":"EditFile"}]}}
